  "permanent_motion": "The red interruption_dot has a continuous, subtle radial glow pulse (opacity oscillating between 0.6 and 1.0 every 60 frames). The Mapbox camera performs an extremely slow, almost imperceptible pan towards the East.",
  "remotion_implementation_notes": "Use Mapbox GL JS with a Mercator projection, centered roughly on [65, 0] (Indian Ocean) with a zoom level around 2.5. For the 'draw-stroke' transition on export_line_solid, use Remotion's interpolate function on the strokeDashoffset property. The scale-pop for ten_percent_text should use spring({fps: 30, config: {damping: 12, stiffness: 90}}). Ensure all SVG overlays are wrapped in AbsoluteFill and positioned absolutely over the Mapbox canvas. Use extrapolateRight: 'clamp' on all interpolations.",
  "fidelity_warnings": "Syncing SVG paths (the export lines) perfectly with a moving Mapbox map is highly complex in Remotion due to projection math. Workaround: Keep the Mapbox camera completely static during this beat, or implement the lines natively as Mapbox GeoJSON LineString layers rather than HTML/SVG overlays to ensure they stick to the geography."
